  "label": "Adolf Hitler",
  "description": "Adolf Hitler was the leader of Nazi Germany and the architect of the Holocaust, responsible for the systematic murder of six million Jews and millions of others. His image is used in the meme to symbolize the perpetrator of genocide. The background knowledge of his role in the Holocaust is essential to understand the meme's hateful intent and its use of his image to represent the perpetrator of mass atrocities.",
